        "title": "Substantial feel and construction....but TINY print.",
        "text": "First, the units is substantial....about the same size as my Samsung S10, but a bit heavier. Construction has all appearances of being robust, although I don't know how it will do if i drop it or something. It charged upo pretty quickly, and worked very well chargin my phone from about 33% to full in about 40 minutes. Easy to operate, thanks to the dual input/output USC-C connections (yes, they are both inputs and outputs....smart circuitry). I read the reviews prior to my purchase, and one person complained about the tiny print on the instruction booklet. It IS tiny, but putting a picture on my phone fixed that right up. Not a problem. Overall, very satisfied with the product.",
